(* Property Graph Markdown 0.4.0 defines no independent grammar.              *)
(*                                                                             *)
(* Parse concept documents as OKF, document structure and links as Markdown,   *)
(* and frontmatter plus complete YAML Flow Mapping link titles as YAML. Every  *)
(* OKF Concept Link has baseline PGM Relationship semantics; a valid Mapping   *)
(* title supplies optional Properties and a derived Graph Element Type. Apply  *)
(* the semantic mapping rules in SPEC.md after those base-format parses.       *)
(*                                                                             *)
(* CommonMark 0.31.2 is the reference grammar for canonical Link syntax. PGM   *)
(* defines no RelationshipExpression, type token, arrow, incoming marker, or   *)
(* PropertyMap production.                                                     *)
